{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55398","headline":"十玄谈（幷序） 玄机 · 常察","name":"十玄谈（幷序） 玄机","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迢迢空劫勿能收，岂爲尘机作系留。\n妙体本来无处所，通身何更问（《大正》本、《偈颂》作「有」）纵由？\n灵然一句超羣象，迥出三乘不假修。\n撒手那边诸（《大正》本、《偈颂》作「千」）圣外，回程堪作火中牛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常察","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55398.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55398","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}